msgid "Importing a file again"
msgstr "Dib u soo dejinta fayl"

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:47
msgid "A row with a start time is skipped as a duplicate when a saved meeting has the same title and date and either the same start time or no start time. A row without a start time is skipped when any saved meeting has the same title and date. Uploading the same file twice does not create copies."
msgstr "Saf leh wakhtiga bilaawga waxaa looga boodaa sidii nuqul labaad markii kulan hore loo keydiyay uu leeyahay isla cinwaanka iyo taariikhda iyo sidoo kale isla wakhtiga bilaawga ama aanu lahayn wax wakhti bilaaw ah. Saf aan lahayn wakhtiga bilaawga waxaa laga boodaa markii kulan kasta oo la keydiyay uu leeyahay isla cinwaanka iyo taariikhda. Soo gelinta isla faylka laba jeer ma abuurto koobiyo."

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:48
msgid "The match uses what is saved on each meeting now, not what the file originally said. If you change a meeting's title or date after importing it, or change its start time to a different time when the row has one, the original row no longer matches and importing that file again creates a new meeting. To change existing meetings, edit them in WordPress instead of importing again."
msgstr "Isku-eekaanshuhu wuxuu adeegsadaa waxa hadda ku keydsan kulan kasta, ma aha wixii faylku asal ahaan sheegayay. Haddii aad beddesho cinwaanka ama taariikhda kulanka ka dib marka aad soo dejiso, ama aad u beddesho wakhtigiisa bilaawga wakhti kale marka safku leeyahay mid, safkii asalka ahaa hadda ka dib ma ekaanayo oo soo gelinta faylkaas mar kale waxay abuureysaa kulan cusub. Si aad wax uga beddesho kulamada jira, ku tafatir WordPress halkii aad mar kale soo gelin lahayd."

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:55
msgid "Upload CSV"
msgstr "Soo geli CSV"

#: partials/csv-import-page.php:56
msgid "Choose a file using the columns above. The first row must be a header row, and each valid row after it creates one meeting."
msgstr "Dooro fayl adoo adeegsanaya tiirarka kore. Safka koowaad waa inuu ahaadaa safka madaxa, saf kasta oo sax ah oo ka dambeeyana wuxuu abuurayaa hal kulan."

